<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Bryan Fury Taunt Jet Upper (Left Side)</Major>
    <Description>One Button Taunt Jet Upper (TJU) for Bryan Fury in Tekken 8.

TJU is one of, if not, the hardest technique in Tekken 8. It takes hundreds of hours of non-stop training to TRULY master it. Meanwhile with this macro everyone can do it!

Instructions:
Make sure to bind 1+3+4 (Taunt Input) to LT, which is L on keyboard for me and therefore will also be represented in the macro.
Sadly this macro is NOT 100% consistent, due to online connection and such, hence why the pause between 1+3+4 and the first forward input is 434ms (You HAVE to alter this time to your personal average connection, i personally have the best result at 434ms but sometimes it whiffs, where as 450ms would have totally hit it.)

If there are any problems with the macro not working, the Keyrun Driver HAS to be enabled during Tekken 8, otherwise the inputs just won't come out.</Description>
    <Comment>Have fun destroying people with disgusting Taunt Set-Ups! 
I recommend watching a YT Video for Set-Ups beforehand, due to TJU being very niche in a real match.

I hope you enjoy! ;)</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 15 1
Delay 32 ms
KeyUp 15 1
Delay 434 ms
KeyDown 79 1
Delay 18 ms
KeyUp 79 1
Delay 20 ms
KeyDown 80 1
KeyDown 24 1
Delay 18 ms
KeyUp 80 1
Delay 18 ms
KeyUp 24 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Tekken 8</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>